WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.034
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:27.304 --> 00:30.907
(Francesca Next Door)

3
00:32.976 --> 00:34.578
(All names of people, places, events, and other details are fictitious.)

4
00:34.644 --> 00:35.912
(AI-based technology was used in part of the production.)

5
00:37.147 --> 00:38.415
Take a look at this.

6
00:38.882 --> 00:41.952
So is this the footage from that accident?

7
00:42.018 --> 00:44.988
That's right. It was caught on the dashcam.

8
00:49.960 --> 00:50.961
But...

9
00:51.661 --> 00:54.164
did you bring the thing you promised?

10
01:28.965 --> 01:30.033
Hey.

11
01:30.934 --> 01:31.935
You...

12
01:36.840 --> 01:37.841
What's wrong?

13
01:39.709 --> 01:42.879
It's too overwhelming...

14
01:43.146 --> 01:44.147
What?

15
01:46.349 --> 01:48.485
Na Young, wake up.

16
01:49.252 --> 01:50.353
What's wrong with you?

17
01:53.123 --> 01:55.759
Hey, can you hear me?

18
02:00.897 --> 02:03.934
Did she have any symptoms before she fell unconscious?

19
02:05.168 --> 02:06.169
I'm not sure.

20
02:06.603 --> 02:09.239
She passed out after having trouble breathing.

21
02:09.306 --> 02:11.174
Check her blood pressure and oxygen saturation,

22
02:11.241 --> 02:12.943
and hook her up to an ECG.

23
02:13.009 --> 02:14.010
Okay.

24
02:14.077 --> 02:15.445
Is it really bad?

25
02:16.012 --> 02:17.847
She looks fine on the outside.

26
02:18.682 --> 02:22.152
Do you know her medical history or what medications she's taking?

27
02:23.086 --> 02:24.788
I don't really know.

28
02:25.088 --> 02:26.523
Does she have a guardian?

29
02:26.856 --> 02:27.857
A guardian...

30
02:29.326 --> 02:30.360
So that's...

31
02:33.430 --> 02:34.698
Oh, hold on.

32
02:39.336 --> 02:40.403
(September 12, Saturday)

33
02:40.470 --> 02:42.572
She'd have his number.

34
02:43.607 --> 02:45.008
(Butler Francisco)

35
02:45.675 --> 02:46.776
"Butler."

36
02:47.644 --> 02:48.812
(Butler Francisco)

37
02:48.878 --> 02:50.046
Are you her guardian?

38
02:51.047 --> 02:52.515
Yes, I am.

39
02:52.949 --> 02:54.951
You have to register at the counter.

40
02:55.318 --> 02:56.753
What is your name, ma'am?

41
02:57.487 --> 02:58.555
Park Bong Gon.

42
03:15.205 --> 03:16.306
Who are you?

43
03:34.924 --> 03:36.159
You already know, right?

44
03:39.396 --> 03:40.397
Yes.

45
03:56.680 --> 03:58.281
She'll feel better now.

46
04:05.321 --> 04:06.356
Na Young.

47
04:07.657 --> 04:08.692
Class president.

48
04:08.892 --> 04:09.959
Are you awake now?

49
04:13.630 --> 04:14.798
How many fingers?

50
04:15.298 --> 04:16.299
One?

51
04:18.168 --> 04:19.703
This is Ms. Park Bong Gon.

52
04:19.769 --> 04:21.037
I'm Francesca.

53
04:24.240 --> 04:26.643
Let's go somewhere else to talk.

54
04:27.510 --> 04:28.611
Can you get up?

55
04:42.892 --> 04:43.893
Come in.

56
04:44.594 --> 04:47.297
No, you wait outside.

57
04:48.131 --> 04:49.866
I need to talk to her alone.

58
05:13.156 --> 05:14.157
Have a seat.

59
05:20.663 --> 05:21.965
I heard about your family.

60
05:22.632 --> 05:25.535
I felt sorry for you, so I rented out my place to you.

61
05:26.402 --> 05:28.838
Is your name also Francesca?

62
05:29.172 --> 05:30.473
That's correct.

63
05:30.540 --> 05:31.641
Just like yours.

64
05:32.809 --> 05:33.977
Anyway...

65
05:34.410 --> 05:35.411
Have you drunk...

66
05:36.813 --> 05:38.815
human blood for the first time recently?

67
05:39.816 --> 05:40.817
I have.

68
05:41.651 --> 05:43.386
How did you know?

69
05:44.120 --> 05:46.790
You kids are far too young to be drinking fresh blood.

70
05:47.624 --> 05:49.459
It's only natural you'd get blood sickness.

71
05:54.664 --> 05:57.200
Was it that boy's blood?

72
06:04.107 --> 06:05.108
What?

73
06:09.479 --> 06:10.480
No.

74
06:12.916 --> 06:14.083
That's good.

75
06:14.918 --> 06:16.252
It could've been disastrous.

76
06:17.053 --> 06:19.422
The stimulus must have been intense.

77
06:20.056 --> 06:24.494
The stronger the attachment, the stronger the urge to drink blood.

78
06:26.095 --> 06:27.096
Attachment?

79
06:29.332 --> 06:31.267
You really have no idea, do you?

80
06:43.179 --> 06:44.180
Francesca.

81
06:45.648 --> 06:47.550
Listen carefully to what I'm about to say.

82
06:48.852 --> 06:50.320
It's extremely important.

83
06:57.060 --> 06:58.361
What's going on?

84
06:58.428 --> 06:59.629
What's she telling her?

85
07:08.304 --> 07:10.106
They die?

86
07:11.274 --> 07:12.542
To be precise,

87
07:13.443 --> 07:16.713
biting a human will still turn them into a vampire, just like it used to.

88
07:17.113 --> 07:19.749
But the virus spreads immediately.

89
07:20.350 --> 07:22.051
They'll die within a year at most.

90
07:26.456 --> 07:27.590
Then...

91
07:27.657 --> 07:31.427
So if you really care about that boy,

92
07:32.428 --> 07:33.763
you should stay away from him.

93
07:36.466 --> 07:38.167
You'll spend the rest of your life missing him...

94
07:39.235 --> 07:40.536
and regretting it.

95
07:44.140 --> 07:45.341
I know. I've been there.

96
08:00.523 --> 08:02.525
Today, you saved my life.

97
08:02.959 --> 08:04.794
If you're grateful, come visit sometime.

98
08:05.995 --> 08:08.498
I hardly have anyone to play Go-Stop with...

99
08:09.332 --> 08:10.500
these days.

100
08:11.134 --> 08:12.302
What's Go-Stop?

101
08:12.568 --> 08:15.271
It's fun. I'll teach you.

102
08:17.206 --> 08:18.207
Okay.

103
08:22.679 --> 08:23.680
Francesca.

104
08:28.985 --> 08:32.889
I sincerely hope you don't make the same mistakes I did.

105
08:35.925 --> 08:36.926
Okay.

106
08:46.402 --> 08:47.537
Have a good night.

107
09:03.586 --> 09:06.456
We sure went through a lot today.

108
09:07.991 --> 09:08.992
Yeah.

109
09:15.798 --> 09:17.467
Are you really okay?

110
09:19.068 --> 09:20.069
Yeah.

111
09:27.343 --> 09:28.478
But...

112
09:30.013 --> 09:32.382
shouldn't we talk about what happened earlier?

113
09:35.051 --> 09:36.052
What?

114
09:37.787 --> 09:40.857
What we did earlier...

115
09:43.326 --> 09:44.327
The kiss...

116
09:48.498 --> 09:49.632
- Class president. - Yeah?

117
09:50.733 --> 09:53.102
Thanks for today. I should get going.

118
09:53.369 --> 09:55.138
I'll walk with you. I live nearby too.

119
09:55.204 --> 09:57.040
No, see you at school.

120
10:16.059 --> 10:17.193
Did you give her that blood?

121
10:22.298 --> 10:25.101
Isn't it only natural for vampires to drink human blood?

122
10:26.202 --> 10:28.271
That doesn't change anything.

123
10:29.238 --> 10:30.907
- Your parents... - Then what about you?

124
10:32.575 --> 10:34.243
You loved without regrets, so...

125
10:36.212 --> 10:37.413
Look how miserable you are now.

126
10:38.047 --> 10:39.082
I know.

127
11:33.703 --> 11:35.738
Good morning.

128
11:35.805 --> 11:37.907
- Good morning. - Good morning.

129
11:37.974 --> 11:40.243
Are you all still asleep?

130
11:40.977 --> 11:42.812
- Did you study? - I did.

131
11:42.879 --> 11:44.013
Oh, really?

132
11:44.080 --> 11:45.548
- That's a lie. - It's not.

133
11:47.583 --> 11:48.684
Where did she go?

134
12:05.535 --> 12:07.103
Where are you? Are you skipping school?

135
12:09.539 --> 12:10.540
Aren't you hungry?

136
12:10.606 --> 12:12.542
- Let's go get dinner. - I'm not hungry.

137
12:13.709 --> 12:15.912
Class president. Were you looking for Pi Na Young?

138
12:16.512 --> 12:17.547
She just came to school.

139
12:17.613 --> 12:18.614
What?

140
12:22.685 --> 12:23.719
Pi Na Young.

141
12:33.696 --> 12:36.165
Dang it, my stomach hurts when I run right after eating.

142
12:37.667 --> 12:39.135
How did he know I was here?

143
12:39.202 --> 12:40.203
Pi Na Young.

144
12:40.703 --> 12:41.771
You scared me.

145
12:43.306 --> 12:44.707
It's new seeing you get startled.

146
12:45.641 --> 12:47.577
What are you doing? Why aren't you in class?

147
12:51.347 --> 12:53.549
I've had enough.

148
12:54.750 --> 12:55.751
What?

149
13:00.223 --> 13:02.491
I don't enjoy studying. Why would I work so hard for it?

150
13:02.892 --> 13:04.794
All just to get free Wi-Fi.

151
13:04.860 --> 13:05.895
And school too.

152
13:05.962 --> 13:09.565
I only came here to eat. I didn't come to play student.

153
13:10.399 --> 13:13.436
- What are you talking... - I don't need you anymore.

154
13:19.408 --> 13:21.444
How stupid do you think I am?

155
13:23.412 --> 13:24.914
At least put some effort into lying.

156
13:25.781 --> 13:27.283
Did you think I'd be hurt just enough...

157
13:27.350 --> 13:30.319
to accept that lousy excuse and back off?

158
13:31.020 --> 13:33.356
I don't know what that woman told you,

159
13:33.823 --> 13:35.458
but I'm not going to just walk away...

160
13:36.158 --> 13:38.461
because you say you don't need me.

161
13:39.729 --> 13:40.863
And besides,

162
13:41.364 --> 13:42.498
I need to get into med scho...

163
13:42.565 --> 13:43.599
You might die!

164
13:47.270 --> 13:50.773
If a vampire bites a human, they get sick and die within a year.

165
13:51.073 --> 13:53.409
You won't get into med school if you're dead.

166
13:53.476 --> 13:54.477
Got it?

167
13:56.312 --> 13:57.380
Now move.

168
13:58.047 --> 13:59.415
Then why did you kiss me?

169
14:06.622 --> 14:07.623
What were we that day?

170
14:08.891 --> 14:09.892
What did it mean?

171
14:16.165 --> 14:18.167
Does that even matter now?

172
14:29.645 --> 14:32.581
(Dooil High School)

173
14:40.489 --> 14:42.191
I guess I can't eat here anymore.

174
14:43.726 --> 14:44.727
I'm hungry, though.

175
14:46.929 --> 14:47.930
Pi Na Young.

176
15:09.218 --> 15:11.153
You're more useful than I thought.

177
15:11.654 --> 15:14.023
Fine. I'll accept you as a friend.

178
15:15.224 --> 15:16.225
What about school?

179
15:20.229 --> 15:22.865
I'm done with school.

180
15:23.532 --> 15:25.634
Really? Why?

181
15:29.472 --> 15:30.873
Because of Jang U Ju?

182
15:38.180 --> 15:39.849
Just think of him as a lunchbox.

183
15:40.649 --> 15:43.486
No one will even know he died because you bit him.

184
15:46.555 --> 15:47.556
Oh, no.

185
15:48.758 --> 15:49.792
Did I upset you?

186
15:52.762 --> 15:55.431
Do you like me?

187
15:56.832 --> 15:57.833
What?

188
15:57.900 --> 15:58.901
Or...

189
15:59.535 --> 16:00.770
do you like U Ju?

190
16:00.836 --> 16:02.104
What are you talking about?

191
16:02.538 --> 16:03.606
Just...

192
16:03.973 --> 16:07.743
you seem awfully bothered by me and him hanging out.

193
16:08.411 --> 16:09.645
Thanks for the food,

194
16:12.114 --> 16:13.416
but that's enough.

195
16:15.317 --> 16:16.318
Hey.

196
16:18.888 --> 16:22.124
Do you know what happens when a human and a vampire get together?

197
16:25.728 --> 16:26.729
What happens?

198
16:29.498 --> 16:30.766
You get someone like me.

199
16:31.667 --> 16:34.537
My father was a vampire, and my mother was human.

200
16:36.038 --> 16:40.576
It's pathetic how my dad always missed my mom...

201
16:42.111 --> 16:43.112
whom I've never even met.

202
16:45.114 --> 16:47.783
I'm just worried you'll make the same mistake.

203
16:49.051 --> 16:50.219
That's why I'm stepping in.

204
16:51.687 --> 16:54.557
So if you can't even control that simple urge...

205
16:54.623 --> 16:55.658
A simple urge?

206
16:57.793 --> 16:58.861
Desire?

207
17:03.098 --> 17:05.301
I've always gotten everything I've wanted.

208
17:05.868 --> 17:08.537
I've never hesitated before eating something I wanted,

209
17:09.104 --> 17:11.173
or buying clothes I wanted to wear.

210
17:12.842 --> 17:13.843
So I'm saying...

211
17:14.777 --> 17:20.249
I'm not stupid enough to mistake this for some simple urge.

212
17:21.717 --> 17:23.853
I don't know what you've been through,

213
17:24.453 --> 17:27.656
but whatever I'm feeling right now...

214
17:28.591 --> 17:29.758
I get to decide what it means.

215
17:30.593 --> 17:31.760
Not you.

216
17:39.235 --> 17:41.937
(1st period: Korean Literature 2nd period: Math)

217
18:02.691 --> 18:03.692
Oh, come on.

218
18:03.759 --> 18:05.895
(Report Card)

219
18:09.031 --> 18:11.634
Why did your grades drop so much?

220
18:15.304 --> 18:16.305
Is it...

221
18:17.540 --> 18:19.909
because of what I asked you before?

222
18:21.277 --> 18:24.113
You've done well up to now,

223
18:25.881 --> 18:28.384
so you could still aim for regular admission...

224
18:28.450 --> 18:31.887
He's been telling me in so many words that I wouldn't get into med school.

225
18:31.954 --> 18:32.955
You're not dropping out, are you?

226
18:33.022 --> 18:35.891
But it didn't bother me at all. That was strange.

227
18:35.958 --> 18:37.259
I've seen students like that.

228
18:37.326 --> 18:40.162
It was almost as if I'd been put under some spell.

229
18:41.330 --> 18:42.331
So...

230
18:43.065 --> 18:45.067
Does that even matter now?

231
18:45.534 --> 18:46.635
I guess not.

232
18:47.403 --> 18:49.104
Why did I say that?

233
18:49.905 --> 18:50.906
What?

234
18:53.709 --> 18:54.910
Nothing.

235
18:55.277 --> 18:57.413
I understand. I'll get going.

236
19:06.922 --> 19:08.824
(Pi Na Young)

237
19:17.600 --> 19:19.134
(Pi Na Young)

238
19:22.204 --> 19:23.238
(CSAT Math)

239
19:30.546 --> 19:34.316
(U Ju told me to choose option 3 if I was stuck.)

240
19:35.951 --> 19:39.521
(Why would Cheol Su do that?)

241
19:58.240 --> 19:59.775
Excuse me.

242
19:59.842 --> 20:00.843
Hey, young lady.

243
20:00.909 --> 20:02.111
You in the black dress!

244
20:06.348 --> 20:08.250
I'm a little weak.

245
20:08.784 --> 20:14.056
Could you push my wheelchair to my house over there?

246
20:18.794 --> 20:19.795
Sure, no problem.

247
20:20.062 --> 20:21.430
Why, thank you.

248
20:30.205 --> 20:31.607
Oh, great.

249
20:31.674 --> 20:33.409
Let's go!

250
20:43.752 --> 20:44.820
Na Young?

251
20:46.588 --> 20:50.059
This should be far enough.

252
20:51.760 --> 20:55.030
Okay. Don't wander too far on your own.

253
20:58.901 --> 21:01.570
You're such a kind girl. Now I feel bad.

254
21:03.739 --> 21:05.140
Why would you feel bad?

255
21:05.207 --> 21:06.575
You should be grateful.

256
21:10.546 --> 21:12.815
No, I really do feel bad.

257
21:25.828 --> 21:26.862
Na Young?

258
21:32.434 --> 21:33.435
Na Young!

259
21:47.216 --> 21:48.851
The license plate...

260
21:48.917 --> 21:51.487
It's 73 Heo 5067.

261
21:56.425 --> 21:57.860
Hello, police?

262
21:58.861 --> 22:00.596
A person got kidnapped.

263
22:00.863 --> 22:01.897
The license plate is...

264
22:02.731 --> 22:04.633
It's 73 Heo 5067.

265
22:05.267 --> 22:07.402
Sorry? The location?

266
22:09.138 --> 22:10.139
Where am I?

267
22:17.079 --> 22:19.314
We'll look it up right away,

268
22:19.381 --> 22:21.784
but it might be impossible to track it down.

269
22:21.850 --> 22:23.385
Let's wait for a bit.

270
22:31.360 --> 22:32.961
Okay, calm down. Think this through.

271
22:33.729 --> 22:34.730
What can I do?

272
22:35.464 --> 22:36.465
What now?

273
22:36.865 --> 22:38.333
My butler does everything for me.

274
22:38.801 --> 22:39.802
Your butler?

275
22:39.868 --> 22:40.969
So you have one at home?

276
22:41.436 --> 22:42.437
Not now.

277
22:42.504 --> 22:43.505
He's out for work.

278
22:44.506 --> 22:45.941
Her butler...

279
22:50.412 --> 22:52.514
What? She got kidnapped?

280
22:52.581 --> 22:54.216
Yes, what should I do?

281
22:54.950 --> 22:55.951
Why would she...

282
22:57.286 --> 22:58.287
Is there a way?

283
23:01.256 --> 23:02.257
There is.

284
23:02.624 --> 23:03.725
What is it?

285
23:03.792 --> 23:06.328
I set up location sharing on her phone...

286
23:06.562 --> 23:08.430
because she's always all over the place.

287
23:08.931 --> 23:10.499
I'll send the link to you now.

288
23:10.699 --> 23:11.700
Okay, thanks.

289
23:14.903 --> 23:16.038
Ms. Francesca...

290
23:18.540 --> 23:20.876
Sir, make a U-turn.

291
23:21.109 --> 23:22.211
Here?

292
23:22.511 --> 23:24.112
If I do that here,

293
23:24.179 --> 23:26.982
we'll both be on the news tomorrow morning.

294
23:27.049 --> 23:28.116
Oh, but...

295
23:31.620 --> 23:33.789
Ms. Francesca!

296
23:33.856 --> 23:35.357
(Truck Helper)

297
23:36.425 --> 23:37.593
(Checking Location)

298
23:37.659 --> 23:38.694
(Current Location)

299
23:38.961 --> 23:39.962
I found her.

300
23:40.829 --> 23:41.864
Hey, taxi.

301
23:42.130 --> 23:44.299
Taxi!

302
23:48.036 --> 23:49.304
Oh, what do I do?

303
23:49.371 --> 23:51.406
Okay, calm down. Try to think.

304
23:55.010 --> 23:56.044
Need a lift?

305
23:57.613 --> 23:58.647
You...

306
23:58.714 --> 23:59.748
Hop on.

307
24:03.452 --> 24:05.087
What? Will you walk instead?

308
24:29.511 --> 24:30.512
What is this?

309
24:34.049 --> 24:35.584
We've been waiting...

310
24:36.752 --> 24:38.654
a long time for your kind.

311
24:40.555 --> 24:41.590
For what?

312
24:41.657 --> 24:42.658
Your kind is...

313
24:49.097 --> 24:50.499
You're a vampire.

314
24:52.401 --> 24:55.137
I don't know what you're talking about.

315
24:55.337 --> 24:57.673
You don't need to pretend.

316
24:57.739 --> 25:00.676
We all know about it.

317
25:12.621 --> 25:14.790
So what do you want from me?

318
25:18.060 --> 25:19.061
So...

319
25:20.095 --> 25:22.297
Just bite us.

320
25:24.299 --> 25:25.300
What?

321
25:25.367 --> 25:27.302
You have immortality and eternal life...

322
25:28.070 --> 25:31.039
all to yourselves. That's not fair!

323
25:32.507 --> 25:35.777
You could share it with us, couldn't you?

324
25:36.611 --> 25:37.846
What the heck is this?

325
25:40.115 --> 25:43.919
We want to become vampires like you.

326
25:43.986 --> 25:45.620
It's easy.

327
25:45.687 --> 25:47.823
Just bite us here and draw some blood...

328
25:47.889 --> 25:49.391
Wait, will it leave a scar?

329
25:49.458 --> 25:50.459
Maybe.

330
25:50.525 --> 25:51.960
Really? Then bite somewhere else...

331
25:52.861 --> 25:54.763
Just give us one bite right here...

332
25:54.830 --> 25:58.567
and draw some blood.

333
25:58.633 --> 25:59.901
That's how we...

334
25:59.968 --> 26:01.036
No.

335
26:01.636 --> 26:02.637
I can't do that.

336
26:03.905 --> 26:05.407
Damn it.

337
26:05.941 --> 26:09.778
I didn't expect you to agree so easily.

338
26:10.679 --> 26:11.747
Well, it can't be helped.

339
26:11.980 --> 26:15.884
Big guy, go get the equipment.

340
26:17.085 --> 26:19.788
- Yes, sir. - Damn it.

341
26:38.473 --> 26:39.741
Hallelujah!

342
26:42.511 --> 26:44.813
- Praise the Lord! - Oh, Father!

343
26:44.880 --> 26:47.282
Bless us with your grace!

344
26:47.849 --> 26:49.484
Father Almighty...

345
26:50.352 --> 26:51.553
Damn it.

346
26:55.891 --> 26:57.259
Are you done yet?

347
26:58.960 --> 27:00.362
Can you untie me already?

348
27:00.996 --> 27:05.400
Hey, none of this is working.

349
27:12.674 --> 27:13.842
Are you sure she's a vampire?

350
27:15.911 --> 27:17.979
- Is she? - What?

351
27:18.046 --> 27:20.182
I told you to find the right one!

352
27:20.248 --> 27:21.983
I saw the footage!

353
27:22.050 --> 27:24.186
She came back to life, just like...

354
27:49.478 --> 27:50.479
Here.

355
27:51.146 --> 27:52.747
You like this, don't you?

356
27:54.015 --> 27:56.485
Come on. Bite me!

357
28:13.768 --> 28:15.070
The signal stopped here.

358
28:18.673 --> 28:19.875
That means...

359
28:32.687 --> 28:33.688
Hey.

360
28:35.857 --> 28:37.292
Why are you suddenly helping me?

361
28:38.460 --> 28:41.229
Is it some kind of vampire solidarity?

362
28:41.830 --> 28:42.831
I don't know.

363
28:43.498 --> 28:44.666
Watching you two together,

364
28:44.733 --> 28:47.602
I guess I wanted to be the bridge for two star-crossed lovers.

365
28:47.969 --> 28:49.070
Cut the crap.

366
28:49.871 --> 28:50.872
It just...

367
28:52.307 --> 28:54.309
reminds me of my dad.

368
28:55.177 --> 28:56.278
I got curious...

369
28:56.845 --> 28:58.647
about what it's like to love someone for a year...

370
28:58.713 --> 29:00.615
and miss them for the rest of your life.

371
29:11.526 --> 29:15.030
I told you, you idiots.

372
29:15.096 --> 29:17.098
If I bite you, you'll die.

373
29:17.699 --> 29:19.868
Don't you get it? You'll die!

374
29:22.404 --> 29:26.675
Do you really think we'd believe that nonsense?

375
29:27.209 --> 29:28.210
Bite me!

376
29:40.522 --> 29:42.090
You people!

377
29:47.395 --> 29:48.997
What's going on here?

378
29:50.332 --> 29:51.433
Who are you?

379
29:51.499 --> 29:52.500
Class president!

380
29:52.867 --> 29:53.868
Hey.

381
29:56.404 --> 29:58.473
Oh, you're one of her kind too.

382
29:58.840 --> 30:01.343
Well, that makes things easier.

383
30:01.409 --> 30:04.112
Then maybe you could...

384
30:04.179 --> 30:06.014
We have no intention of biting you.

385
30:07.882 --> 30:09.951
And we don't want any trouble.

386
30:11.086 --> 30:13.154
Just put away those useless props.

387
30:13.421 --> 30:14.956
We can talk this out peacefully...

388
30:16.191 --> 30:17.192
Hey, you...

389
30:17.259 --> 30:19.361
Are you okay?

390
30:25.000 --> 30:26.334
I was hoping we could settle this peacefully,

391
30:28.236 --> 30:29.371
but I guess that's not happening.

392
30:46.788 --> 30:48.356
Oh, it hurts!

393
30:55.297 --> 30:57.365
Stop kicking me!

394
31:04.673 --> 31:05.674
What are you doing?

395
31:06.308 --> 31:07.375
Are you just going to lie there?

396
31:32.801 --> 31:33.802
Gosh.

397
31:42.444 --> 31:45.046
You look too healthy to be pushed in a wheelchair.

398
31:48.216 --> 31:49.851
Just bite me once.

399
31:51.453 --> 31:52.454
No.

400
31:53.054 --> 31:54.122
Please.

401
31:54.422 --> 31:55.423
No.

402
31:57.092 --> 31:58.159
Bite me.

403
31:58.226 --> 31:59.260
No.

404
31:59.327 --> 32:00.462
- Do it! - No!

405
32:00.762 --> 32:03.531
Just bite me once. Please, just...

406
32:03.598 --> 32:04.632
I said no.

407
32:33.261 --> 32:34.562
I knew.

408
32:34.796 --> 32:36.064
U Ju!

409
32:37.232 --> 32:40.568
I knew Pi Na Young would come back even if she fell.

410
32:42.504 --> 32:43.772
I knew that, but...

411
33:12.567 --> 33:13.568
Jang U Ju!

412
33:17.272 --> 33:18.273
U Ju...

413
33:19.407 --> 33:20.608
No...

414
33:25.280 --> 33:26.481
It's my...

415
33:26.915 --> 33:28.049
first time...

416
33:29.250 --> 33:30.285
seeing you cry.

417
33:31.553 --> 33:32.787
Why is that important now?

418
33:34.422 --> 33:35.423
What do we do?

419
33:37.158 --> 33:38.159
Do something.

420
33:41.729 --> 33:42.997
There's only one way.

421
33:53.508 --> 33:54.509
No.

422
33:55.143 --> 33:56.744
He'll die within a year.

423
33:56.811 --> 33:58.546
He'll die anyway if we leave him like this.

424
34:05.153 --> 34:06.154
It's your choice,

425
34:07.121 --> 34:08.122
Francesca.

426
34:26.841 --> 34:27.842
Jang U Ju.

427
34:30.478 --> 34:31.479
Pi Na Young?

428
34:37.519 --> 34:38.520
Now,

429
34:39.254 --> 34:42.457
I've got good news and bad news for you.

430
34:44.192 --> 34:45.360
Which do you want to hear first?

431
34:48.263 --> 34:49.364
The bad news.

432
34:50.131 --> 34:51.399
The bad news is,

433
34:52.433 --> 34:55.103
you've got one year left to live, at most.

434
34:59.774 --> 35:01.075
And the good news is...

435
35:01.943 --> 35:03.778
The great-aunt is here.

436
35:31.573 --> 35:32.640
Welcome...

437
35:35.209 --> 35:36.244
to the world of vampires.

438
35:40.949 --> 35:44.018
The son of blood!

439
35:44.519 --> 35:47.188
- The son of blood! - The son of blood!

440
36:07.609 --> 36:10.545
(Francesca Next Door)
